<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="intro-inference">
  <title>Introduction to Statistical Inference</title>
  
  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter introduces statistical inference. For an applied example of uncertainty quantification in
      public forecasting, see FiveThirtyEight's explanation of its election forecast
      <url href="https://fivethirtyeight.com/features/how-fivethirtyeights-election-forecast-works/">online</url>.
    </p>
  </introduction>

</chapter>
